"title": "Ondoa Uovu",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "ondoa uovu",
"language": "swh",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Dhambi inapingana sana na utakatifu wa Mungu kiasi kwamba haiwezi kuwepo pamoja naye. Vivyo hivyo, inapaswa kuwa hivyo kwa watu wa Mungu. Mungu ni mtakatifu, na anatarajia watu wake kuonyesha utakatifu wake (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03011045\" data-end-ref=\"03011045\">Mambo ya Walawi 11:45</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03019002\" data-end-ref=\"03019002\">19:2</data>).</p><p>Mungu alihitaji hatua kali ili kuondoa dhambi kutoka kwa jamii ya agano. Mungu alitoa msamaha, lakini tu kwa wale ambao walikuwa wameungama kwa dhati. Wale ambao walikuwa wakaidi wangeweza kutarajia hukumu ya Mungu. Hukumu hii ilikuwa mchakato wa utakaso uliowateketeza wenye dhambi na dhambi zao, bila kuacha chochote (tazama <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05009003\" data-end-ref=\"05009003\">Kumbukumbu la Torati 9:3</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05013005\" data-end-ref=\"05013005\">13:5</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23033014\" data-end-ref=\"23033014\">Isaiah 33:14</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58012028\" data-end-ref=\"58012029\">Waebrania 12:28–29</data>). Utakaso huu ulikusudiwa kuponya jamii ya waumini katika Bwana na kuzuia wengine wasiotee dhidi yake (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05017013\" data-end-ref=\"05017013\">Kumbukumbu la Torati 17:13</data>).</p><p>Kwenye Agano la Kale, Mungu mara nyingi aliwahukumu watu wake mara moja (tazama, kwa mfano, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04011001\" data-end-ref=\"04011003\">Hesabu 11:1–3</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04016001\" data-end-ref=\"04016050\">16:1–50</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06007001\" data-end-ref=\"06007026\">Yoshua 7</data>). Hii iliwafanya watu wake wawe na ufahamu mkubwa wa madai yake ya utiifu na matokeo ya kutotii.</p><p>Adhabu ya mwisho ya Mungu imepangwa kwa siku ya baadaye ya haki, wakati atakapofunua na kuhukumu dhambi za watu wote (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45014010\" data-end-ref=\"45014010\">Warumi 14:10</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"47005010\" data-end-ref=\"47005010\">2 Wakorintho 5:10</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58009027\" data-end-ref=\"58009027\">Waebrania 9:27</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60004005\" data-end-ref=\"60004005\">1 Petro 4:5</data>). Hata hivyo, baadhi ya majanga yanaweza kuonekana kama hukumu ya Mungu juu ya watu wake wasiotii (kwa mfano, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44005001\" data-end-ref=\"44005011\">Matendo 5:1–11</data>; tazama <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46011027\" data-end-ref=\"46011030\">1 Wakorintho 11:27–30</data>). Bado ni &quot;jambo la kutisha kuanguka mikononi mwa Mungu aliye hai&quot; (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58010031\" data-end-ref=\"58010031\">Waebrania 10:31</data>).</p><p><u>Sehemu za Kujifunza Zaidi</u></p><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03019001\" data-end-ref=\"03019002\">Walawi 19:1–2</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05009003\" data-end-ref=\"05009006\">Kumbukumbu la Torati 9:3–6</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05013005\" data-end-ref=\"05013005\">13:5</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05017002\" data-end-ref=\"05017013\">17:2–13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06007001\" data-end-ref=\"06007026\">Yoshua 7:1–26</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14034003\" data-end-ref=\"14034008\">2 Mambo ya Nyakati 34:3–8</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23001024\" data-end-ref=\"23001026\">Isaya 1:24–26</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23004002\" data-end-ref=\"23004006\">4:2–6</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23033014\" data-end-ref=\"23033014\">33:14</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26020032\" data-end-ref=\"26020038\">Ezekieli 20:32–38</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40018008\" data-end-ref=\"40018009\">Mathayo 18:8–9</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44005001\" data-end-ref=\"44005011\">Matendo 5:1–11</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45014010\" data-end-ref=\"45014010\">Warumi 14:10</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46011027\" data-end-ref=\"46011030\">1 Wakorintho 11:27–30</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"47005010\" data-end-ref=\"47005010\">2 Wakorintho 5:10</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58009027\" data-end-ref=\"58009028\">Waebrania 9:27–28</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58010031\" data-end-ref=\"58010031\">10:31</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58012028\" data-end-ref=\"58012029\">12:28–29</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"59005019\" data-end-ref=\"59005020\">Yakobo 5:19–20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60004005\" data-end-ref=\"60004005\">1 Petro 4:5</data></p>",
